WEBVTT

01:30.530 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.150 --> 01:37.890
[Episode 26]

01:39.570 --> 01:40.570
Where am I?

01:42.729 --> 01:43.640
Is anyone here?

01:47.950 --> 01:49.039
Hello?

01:57.810 --> 01:59.479
Anyone around?

02:08.250 --> 02:09.210
How beautiful.

02:13.800 --> 02:14.430
Xiao Yao,

02:15.030 --> 02:16.090
is this really you?

02:17.190 --> 02:18.280
Gorgeous,

02:18.470 --> 02:19.560
stunning—

02:20.030 --> 02:22.079
perfect descriptions of you.

02:25.590 --> 02:26.710
But who am I now?

02:30.630 --> 02:31.430
Who's there?

02:32.190 --> 02:33.270
Your Highness,

02:33.430 --> 02:34.560
it's time for lunch.

02:36.190 --> 02:37.190
"Your Highness"?

02:39.710 --> 02:41.240
Am I in the imperial palace?

02:41.870 --> 02:44.710
I am Princess Ning'an?

02:44.740 --> 02:46.070
Yes, Your Highness.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.170
Anything wrong?

02:53.800 --> 02:54.590
What else?

02:55.000 --> 02:57.650
Your Highness rarely talks to others

02:57.840 --> 02:59.710
and enjoys reading, writing, and painting

02:59.710 --> 03:02.080
in your bedchamber alone.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.630
Your Highness doesn't even show

03:03.630 --> 03:05.960
much interest in items of gold and silver.

03:10.750 --> 03:11.610
Your Highness?

03:12.310 --> 03:13.000
Go on.

03:15.430 --> 03:16.560
Has the princess...

03:17.840 --> 03:18.630
I mean, have I

03:19.470 --> 03:21.270
been like this since childhood?

03:22.079 --> 03:23.000
Well...

03:23.750 --> 03:24.560
Say it.

03:26.750 --> 03:27.910
I heard

03:28.400 --> 03:29.360
Your Highness

03:29.470 --> 03:30.870
was given birth by a maid.

03:30.870 --> 03:33.030
Disdaining such humble origins,
His Majesty has always

03:33.030 --> 03:34.490
neglected Your Highness.

03:34.750 --> 03:36.190
Your Highness doesn't even

03:36.190 --> 03:38.190
get to see His Majesty once in a year.

03:38.360 --> 03:41.079
That's why Your Highness
has grown increasingly silent.

03:41.079 --> 03:42.240
As time passes,

03:42.360 --> 03:44.560
rumor even has it that Your Highness...

03:44.630 --> 03:46.079
is a jinx.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.280
Have I...

03:54.790 --> 03:57.030
always looked like this?

03:57.800 --> 03:58.280
Yes.

04:09.430 --> 04:10.470
What's your name?

04:11.190 --> 04:12.240
It's Mocui,

04:12.750 --> 04:14.610
which was given by Your Highness.

04:19.120 --> 04:20.000
I'm just teasing you

04:20.000 --> 04:20.950
and joking around.

04:20.950 --> 04:22.510
Of course I know your name is Mocui.

04:22.510 --> 04:24.120
I realize I've been like this
since I was little.

04:24.120 --> 04:26.120
I'm also aware that I'm Princess Ning'an.

04:26.120 --> 04:28.180
All those questions were only a test.

04:29.070 --> 04:29.720
Mocui,

04:30.390 --> 04:31.240
do you know

04:31.430 --> 04:33.130
where demons reside now?

04:33.390 --> 04:34.350
No, I don't.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.360
Your Highness,

04:35.360 --> 04:37.070
please do not speak of demons again,

04:37.070 --> 04:39.530
or His Majesty will impose
more punishment.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.120
"More"?

04:42.680 --> 04:44.510
Previously,
Your Highness spoke for demons.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.159
His Majesty learned about it,

04:46.159 --> 04:47.480
went absolutely livid,

04:47.480 --> 04:48.800
and ordered to confine Your Highness

04:48.800 --> 04:49.930
to your bedchamber.

04:56.360 --> 04:56.870
Got it.

04:57.360 --> 04:58.630
Your Highness, you cannot go out.

04:58.630 --> 05:00.240
There will be more punishment
if His Majesty finds out,

05:00.240 --> 05:01.100
Your Highness!

05:04.920 --> 05:05.580
Step aside.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.310
We're guarding Yong'an Palace
by imperial order.

05:07.310 --> 05:09.710
We beg for Your Highness's understanding.

05:25.610 --> 05:27.070
You guys will pay for this.

05:32.300 --> 05:33.360
How come I can't use

05:33.520 --> 05:35.250
spiritual power in this place?

05:42.830 --> 05:44.270
Both of you, hurry up.

05:44.360 --> 05:46.420
There are many other places to clean.

05:49.630 --> 05:50.040
Give it to me.

05:50.040 --> 05:50.390
Sure.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.800
Be careful.

05:51.830 --> 05:52.270
Yes.

06:03.560 --> 06:04.430
Alright.

06:04.510 --> 06:06.510
Come with me to check out other places.

06:06.510 --> 06:06.870
Yes.

06:06.870 --> 06:07.310
Sure.

06:07.950 --> 06:08.880
Watch your step.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.150
Your Highness.

06:27.150 --> 06:28.010
Your Highness.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.330
Your Highness,

06:33.330 --> 06:34.310
if you run away,

06:34.310 --> 06:36.240
we lowly servants will lose our heads.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.300
Please forgive us.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.830
I'm only forbidden from leaving
Yong'an Palace,

06:42.830 --> 06:44.550
not the bedchamber!

06:48.750 --> 06:51.270
The princess barely carried any authority.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.920
What are these?

07:01.950 --> 07:04.010
Even the books she read are so boring.

07:15.850 --> 07:17.090
[Drunk and seated alone,
to whom shall I tell my sorrow?]

07:17.110 --> 07:18.130
[The waning autumn moon will not be whole.
Snow lies lonely on frontier mountains.]

07:21.980 --> 07:23.780
Did Ning'an write this?

07:25.160 --> 07:28.160
Drunk and seated alone,

07:29.310 --> 07:32.370
to whom shall I tell my sorrow?

07:32.680 --> 07:36.870
The waning autumn moon will not be whole.

07:37.800 --> 07:40.950
Snow lies lonely on frontier mountains.

07:48.840 --> 07:52.170
Where did the Demon Lord hide
a hundred years before my time?

07:52.560 --> 07:54.530
When will I ever find Hong Ye?

07:55.460 --> 07:57.270
[Yong'an Palace]

07:56.720 --> 07:57.580
Your Highness.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.340
Your Highness,

08:01.600 --> 08:02.800
it's time for dinner.

08:11.800 --> 08:12.660
Your Highness?

08:16.870 --> 08:17.870
Your Highness...

08:18.040 --> 08:18.680
Sit down.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.430
Please spare me, Your Highness.

08:21.430 --> 08:23.920
Just put on my clothes
and sleep here tonight.

08:23.920 --> 08:25.720
I promise to be back before dawn.

08:26.270 --> 08:27.390
But I dare not.

08:28.630 --> 08:31.160
Will you undress yourself
or shall I help you?

08:31.920 --> 08:33.059
I'll do it myself.

08:35.020 --> 08:36.730
I beg you, Your Highness.

08:36.750 --> 08:38.480
Please do return before dawn.

08:53.790 --> 08:55.190
The Demon King is coming!

08:55.310 --> 08:56.320
The Demon King is coming!

08:56.320 --> 08:57.030
The Demon King is coming!

08:57.030 --> 08:58.200
What? What's going on?

08:58.200 --> 08:58.720
Run!

08:58.720 --> 08:59.300
Run!

09:00.240 --> 09:00.910
What's happening?

09:00.910 --> 09:02.600
The Feiyu Guard set a trap
to catch the Demon King,

09:02.600 --> 09:04.150
yet the latter still managed to escape!

09:04.150 --> 09:06.810
Run, or you'll die
when the Demon King gets here!

09:09.320 --> 09:10.620
The Demon King?

09:19.320 --> 09:20.480
Feiyu Guards on a demon hunt!

09:20.480 --> 09:22.210
Those who obstruct us will die!

09:35.870 --> 09:37.600
I have no intention of killing.

09:37.960 --> 09:40.520
All I want is to retrieve
the sacred artifact of us demons.

09:40.520 --> 09:42.120
Since it's not in your place,

09:42.740 --> 09:44.470
I'll go search somewhere else.

09:45.210 --> 09:45.950
You demon!

09:47.550 --> 09:48.220
Demon,

09:48.360 --> 09:50.030
you think you can enter and leave
the imperial palace

09:50.030 --> 09:51.090
just as you please?

09:53.000 --> 09:53.840
Then let's see

09:53.840 --> 09:55.550
if you're able to stop me.

10:46.880 --> 10:51.530
[Yong'an Palace]

10:52.720 --> 10:54.270
Hong Ye was formidable.

10:55.200 --> 10:57.730
How did Princess Ning'an
manage to wound him?

10:59.500 --> 11:01.740
Hong Ye didn't recognize me just now.

11:02.150 --> 11:05.840
That means he hadn't known Ning'an
by this moment a hundred years ago.

11:05.840 --> 11:07.270
He could've just fled.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.670
Why did he turn back?

11:09.200 --> 11:10.480
Was it to save me?

11:13.830 --> 11:15.550
But why would he save me?

11:16.120 --> 11:18.030
Does he know who I am or not?

12:28.750 --> 12:30.080
What are you looking at?

12:32.240 --> 12:34.170
You're that maid I just met, right?

12:36.390 --> 12:36.960
Yes, I am.

12:38.780 --> 12:39.880
Well, not exactly.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.960
May I ask if you're here to
deflower a maiden

12:46.960 --> 12:48.760
or to have a clandestine affair?

12:59.120 --> 13:00.450
Aren't you afraid of me?

13:01.330 --> 13:02.930
Why should I be afraid of you?

13:03.730 --> 13:06.590
Don't all you humans
fear being devoured by demons?

13:08.760 --> 13:10.700
How handsome of you.

13:10.760 --> 13:12.790
You don't strike me
as a man-eating monster.

13:12.790 --> 13:13.550
Besides,

13:13.550 --> 13:15.630
if you wanted to eat humans,
you would've done so already,

13:15.630 --> 13:18.390
instead of browsing around over there.

13:22.510 --> 13:23.390
Interesting.

13:31.550 --> 13:33.680
You're still as good-looking as ever.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.500
Who are you really?

13:40.560 --> 13:41.650
I am...

13:45.300 --> 13:46.070
What?

13:55.280 --> 13:57.610
Xiao Yao didn't exist a hundred years ago.

13:58.740 --> 14:00.720
I guess I'll have to acquaint with him

14:00.720 --> 14:02.450
using the identity of Ning'an.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.080
I am Ning'an.

14:07.390 --> 14:08.790
May I have your name?

14:13.870 --> 14:15.240
Has my message been passed along?

14:14.600 --> 14:17.670
[Wang Hong]

14:15.240 --> 14:16.300
Rest assured, sir.

14:16.440 --> 14:18.100
He who dares to spill a word
about what just happened

14:18.100 --> 14:19.670
will make an enemy of us Feiyu Guards.

14:18.520 --> 14:20.990
[Yong'an Palace]

14:19.750 --> 14:20.320
Good.

14:24.600 --> 14:25.670
Has the princess's bedchamber

14:25.670 --> 14:26.530
been searched?

14:27.630 --> 14:28.480
Not yet.

14:32.800 --> 14:33.990
Princess Ning'an

14:34.010 --> 14:36.080
is being confined...

14:37.140 --> 14:38.470
for defending demons.

14:39.470 --> 14:40.700
Don't leave!

14:41.000 --> 14:41.930
-Let go.
-You...

14:42.030 --> 14:42.640
No way.

14:42.790 --> 14:43.790
-Let go.
-I won't!

14:44.240 --> 14:44.720
Let go of me!

14:44.720 --> 14:45.630
As my father says,

14:45.630 --> 14:47.670
persistent pursuit wears down
the strongest resistance.

14:47.670 --> 14:48.440
I must hold onto you.

14:48.440 --> 14:48.960
Let go!

14:49.080 --> 14:49.600
No way!

14:50.120 --> 14:51.220
Is this the etiquette

14:51.220 --> 14:52.880
the human emperor taught you?

14:52.910 --> 14:53.620
Yes.

14:57.160 --> 14:58.100
Hong Ye!

15:03.150 --> 15:04.580
How do you know my name?

15:04.630 --> 15:05.150
I...

15:08.360 --> 15:08.870
Tell me.

15:12.750 --> 15:14.240
I dreamed of you.

15:18.530 --> 15:20.640
A man who looked exactly like you

15:20.700 --> 15:22.860
in my dream told me he was named Hong Ye.

15:23.960 --> 15:25.690
I don't know how that happened.

15:29.600 --> 15:31.630
Even as a royal princess,

15:32.110 --> 15:32.840
I'm nothing

15:33.030 --> 15:34.630
but a poor girl despised by her father

15:34.630 --> 15:37.360
and regarded as a jinx by all
in the imperial palace.

15:37.360 --> 15:39.100
Everyone avoids me.

15:40.050 --> 15:41.930
But finally, you showed up.

15:42.790 --> 15:43.920
Could you please...

15:46.440 --> 15:48.120
stay and talk with me?

15:49.840 --> 15:52.170
I'm confined in my bedchamber all day long

15:52.280 --> 15:55.100
with no one to talk to.

15:55.360 --> 15:56.850
I'm all by myself,

15:56.880 --> 15:58.490
helpless and forlorn.

16:00.150 --> 16:02.000
Just stay and talk with me,

16:02.000 --> 16:02.750
will you?

16:03.960 --> 16:05.290
You're being confined?

16:05.680 --> 16:08.210
This pity play still works on him
as expected.

16:08.400 --> 16:08.790
Yes.

16:13.650 --> 16:15.310
What does it have to do with me?

16:18.200 --> 16:19.060
Your Highness,

16:19.080 --> 16:20.210
have you gone to bed?

16:25.740 --> 16:26.930
Her Highness is sound asleep.

16:26.930 --> 16:29.580
Why not come back in the morning, sir?

16:32.320 --> 16:34.630
You know the consequences
of keeping Feiyu Guards

16:34.630 --> 16:35.900
from carrying out duties.

16:35.900 --> 16:37.550
It's inappropriate to search
Her Highness's bedchamber,

16:37.550 --> 16:38.750
since she's a lady after all.

16:38.750 --> 16:39.550
On top of that,

16:39.670 --> 16:42.270
there's no way Her Highness
would pilfer palace artifacts.

16:42.270 --> 16:44.270
We heard Her Highness
made several failed attempts

16:44.270 --> 16:45.550
to leave the palace today.

16:45.550 --> 16:47.600
Given our duty to safeguard the palace,

16:47.600 --> 16:49.730
we must ensure Her Highness's safety.

16:51.790 --> 16:52.390
Halt.

16:52.670 --> 16:53.530
Her Highness is asleep.

16:53.530 --> 16:54.590
You must not enter.

16:56.440 --> 16:57.770
This is a matter of duty.

16:57.790 --> 16:58.960
Sorry for intruding,

16:58.960 --> 16:59.820
Your Highness.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.000
Out of the way!

17:05.349 --> 17:06.210
Your Highness!

17:07.109 --> 17:09.310
An incident occurred
in the palace tonight.

17:09.310 --> 17:10.970
Was Your Highness disturbed?

17:34.480 --> 17:36.080
Fancy finding Your Highness

17:36.110 --> 17:37.710
in the mood to play the zither

17:37.960 --> 17:39.420
in the middle of the night.

17:44.960 --> 17:47.020
Why haven't you knelt in my presence?

17:47.070 --> 17:48.350
How bold of you!

17:48.880 --> 17:49.280
You...

17:50.070 --> 17:50.600
Y-You...

17:50.880 --> 17:51.950
A-Are you...

17:52.160 --> 17:53.420
the maid I saw earlier?

17:53.720 --> 17:54.400
"Maid"?

17:56.240 --> 17:57.440
Are you suggesting

17:57.440 --> 17:58.610
you saw me earlier?

17:59.960 --> 18:00.590
When?

18:02.400 --> 18:03.070
Where?

18:10.750 --> 18:12.030
I was mistaken.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.350
Your Highness has spent

18:14.350 --> 18:16.150
the entire day in the bedchamber

18:16.550 --> 18:17.610
playing the zither

18:18.160 --> 18:19.220
for stress relief.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.540
We humble servants

18:26.990 --> 18:29.550
are just looking for
missing palace artifacts.

18:29.550 --> 18:30.610
Hope Your Highness

18:30.840 --> 18:32.580
can show some understanding.

18:32.920 --> 18:34.750
By breaking into my bedchamber,

18:35.480 --> 18:37.480
you've completed your task, right?

18:43.510 --> 18:44.310
How dare you!

18:46.270 --> 18:47.130
Your Highness,

18:47.200 --> 18:48.480
you're compassionate about demons.

18:48.480 --> 18:50.610
Why not be compassionate about us too?

18:57.250 --> 18:59.250
We're only carrying out our duties.

19:01.790 --> 19:02.410
Get out!

19:02.480 --> 19:03.370
Get out now!

19:08.980 --> 19:10.250
This is outrageous.

19:17.270 --> 19:17.960
Scram.

19:23.510 --> 19:24.160
I...

19:24.910 --> 19:26.130
mean no offense.

19:26.550 --> 19:27.680
-Please...
-Scram!

19:36.920 --> 19:39.270
They really drove me up the wall.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.200
Mocui.

19:45.240 --> 19:45.650
Yes.

19:45.680 --> 19:46.790
Leave the room as well.

19:46.790 --> 19:47.830
Nobody is allowed in

19:47.830 --> 19:48.720
unless I order otherwise.

19:48.720 --> 19:49.160
Yes.

20:06.000 --> 20:06.680
Hong Ye!

20:08.750 --> 20:09.950
Where are you hiding?

20:11.160 --> 20:11.880
Hong Ye?

20:14.110 --> 20:14.750
I'm here.

20:39.440 --> 20:40.770
Don't break the zither.

20:57.280 --> 20:58.140
Lift your foot.

21:02.100 --> 21:02.900
The other one.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.750
Why are you so interested in this zither?

21:29.200 --> 21:33.780
[Yong'an Palace]

21:55.200 --> 21:57.200
She's so keen on playing the zither.

22:00.270 --> 22:01.350
Princess Ning'an

22:02.270 --> 22:03.940
is not submissive at all,

22:03.970 --> 22:05.630
as opposed to what people say.

22:06.270 --> 22:07.600
She's quite something.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.550
The princess still behaves
with such forbearance

22:09.550 --> 22:11.010
despite years of His Majesty's neglect.

22:11.010 --> 22:12.940
She's certainly no ordinary girl.

22:13.810 --> 22:14.960
From now on,

22:15.600 --> 22:17.220
keep close watch on Yong'an Palace.

22:17.050 --> 22:24.070
[Yong'an Palace]

22:17.510 --> 22:18.030
Yes.

22:30.750 --> 22:32.810
You actually play the zither so well.

22:32.960 --> 22:34.620
Why didn't you tell me before?

22:36.000 --> 22:36.640
"Before"?

22:41.310 --> 22:41.910
Oh, right.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.890
We weren't exactly close before.

22:44.480 --> 22:45.200
This zither

22:46.000 --> 22:47.530
is what demons hold sacred,

22:47.790 --> 22:48.880
named Fuxi.

22:50.400 --> 22:51.510
I came to the imperial palace

22:51.510 --> 22:53.240
specifically for this zither.

22:54.480 --> 22:56.740
I didn't expect it to be in your chambers.

23:00.110 --> 23:02.430
To restore Hong Ye's spiritual power,

23:02.750 --> 23:05.880
you need only collect a single drop
of his tear-essence.

23:07.310 --> 23:08.710
I'll give you the zither,

23:10.030 --> 23:11.760
provided that you do me a favor.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.480
What is it?

23:17.160 --> 23:17.750
Alright.

23:18.160 --> 23:18.890
Let's begin.

23:20.790 --> 23:21.680
Don't blink.

23:25.720 --> 23:26.920
Wave your hand

23:27.070 --> 23:28.400
to send air to your eyes.

23:32.920 --> 23:33.850
Close your eyes.

23:34.880 --> 23:35.550
Try hard.

23:37.440 --> 23:38.070
Harder.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.070
Alright. Try again.

23:41.070 --> 23:42.190
One, two, three.

23:42.510 --> 23:44.440
Cry!

23:45.200 --> 23:46.590
As I already told you,

23:46.960 --> 23:48.660
demons don't easily cry.

23:48.960 --> 23:51.440
I didn't cry
even in the face of catastrophes.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.660
I've never seen my own tears myself.

23:54.310 --> 23:55.410
How ridiculous.

23:55.510 --> 23:57.110
This folly is a waste of time.

23:58.110 --> 23:58.870
Let go.

23:59.880 --> 24:01.350
You're basically robbing me.

24:01.350 --> 24:03.200
This is a sacred artifact of demons.

24:03.200 --> 24:05.270
You humans just seized it from us.

24:05.310 --> 24:08.310
It is now simply being returned
to its rightful owner.

24:08.880 --> 24:09.920
I said let go.

24:10.160 --> 24:10.860
No way.

24:11.440 --> 24:13.350
T-T-This zither is the only gift

24:13.350 --> 24:15.150
that my father has ever given me.

24:15.200 --> 24:18.730
Now you're taking it with a mere claim
that it belongs to demons.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.960
You've even tried to intimidate me,

24:20.960 --> 24:22.940
yelled at me, and bullied me.

24:30.010 --> 24:31.640
I was left alone and miserable as a child.

24:31.640 --> 24:33.340
My mother passed away early.

24:33.880 --> 24:35.680
My father doesn't care about me.

24:36.000 --> 24:38.730
Nobody in all the imperial palace
likes me.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.270
When you appeared,

24:43.270 --> 24:45.100
I thought we could be friends.

24:46.070 --> 24:48.670
But as it turns out,
you only care for my zither.

24:49.840 --> 24:50.610
"Friends"?

24:52.160 --> 24:54.350
After knowing each other
for just a few hours,

24:54.350 --> 24:56.080
do we count as friends already?

24:59.200 --> 25:01.130
I've lived for thousands of years,

25:01.440 --> 25:02.970
yet I've never had a friend.

25:04.250 --> 25:05.270
Perfect.

25:05.290 --> 25:07.290
Then I'll be your friend from now on.

25:24.310 --> 25:25.430
Apart from my tears,

25:25.430 --> 25:26.630
what else do you want?

25:27.000 --> 25:29.000
As long as I can have the zither back,

25:29.590 --> 25:31.160
I'll try my best to meet your needs.

25:31.160 --> 25:33.030
A soft heart lies beneath
Hong Ye's tough exterior.

25:33.030 --> 25:34.160
I'll have to soothe his nerves

25:34.160 --> 25:35.890
while seeking another chance.

25:36.510 --> 25:37.110
Great.

25:38.000 --> 25:40.600
Then would you keep me company
and talk with me?

25:42.270 --> 25:43.270
Tell me

25:43.400 --> 25:45.860
what it's like
outside the imperial palace.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.070
In terms of natural scenery,

25:48.070 --> 25:49.870
Mount Qingyuan alone comprises

25:49.920 --> 25:52.120
countless ridges stretching far away.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.720
Mountains aside,

25:54.310 --> 25:55.530
there are two major seas:

25:55.530 --> 25:56.680
the West Sea and the East Sea.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.140
They're vast and magnificent,

25:58.140 --> 25:59.870
dotted with numerous islands.

26:00.270 --> 26:01.480
Beyond those,

26:01.830 --> 26:05.160
there are many mysterious places
that neither of our races have explored.

26:05.160 --> 26:06.360
This boundless world

26:06.400 --> 26:08.110
is endowed with abundant resources.

26:08.110 --> 26:10.310
Nature gives life
to all sorts of creatures,

26:10.310 --> 26:12.920
which all share in the radiant grace
of the sun and moon.

26:12.920 --> 26:14.830
Not just mountains, rivers,
lakes, and seas,

26:14.830 --> 26:16.030
but every living being

26:16.030 --> 26:18.160
can draw energy from heaven and earth.

26:20.610 --> 26:23.010
Are there pig demons
in the Demons' Valley?

26:24.070 --> 26:25.640
And peony flowers that have just

26:25.640 --> 26:26.720
taken human form?

26:29.110 --> 26:31.480
You said you've never left
the imperial palace.

26:31.480 --> 26:33.940
How do you know so much
about the demon realm?

26:34.350 --> 26:36.000
Do those who have ventured
outside the palace

26:36.000 --> 26:38.660
necessarily have knowledge
of the demon realm?

26:41.400 --> 26:41.880
No.

26:42.310 --> 26:44.270
So, it takes one's heart

26:44.350 --> 26:46.510
rather than one's eyes

26:46.880 --> 26:48.880
to actually learn about something.

26:48.880 --> 26:50.240
For me, understanding is gained

26:50.240 --> 26:52.160
by seeing things
from another's perspective.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.890
All humans want to kill demons,

26:55.300 --> 26:57.030
but you're quite an exception.

26:57.920 --> 27:00.050
That's because I'm no ordinary human.

27:03.510 --> 27:04.120
Oh no.

27:04.200 --> 27:05.460
The look in his eyes...

27:05.510 --> 27:07.710
He's now taking me as Princess Ning'an,

27:07.830 --> 27:08.830
not Xiao Yao.

27:09.440 --> 27:11.370
Don't you dare fall in love with me!

27:12.960 --> 27:13.700
Nonsense!

27:14.240 --> 27:15.750
I met you just a moment ago.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.950
How can I possibly...

27:19.550 --> 27:21.080
This is absolutely absurd.

27:22.720 --> 27:24.550
Who knows what the future holds?

27:26.550 --> 27:28.230
I am a human after all.

27:28.350 --> 27:31.210
I'm just worried
that you might hate me for what I am.

27:32.470 --> 27:35.000
In fact, since humans and demons
are both creatures of this world.

27:35.000 --> 27:37.130
we shouldn't be hostile to each other.

27:37.550 --> 27:38.410
Besides,

27:38.880 --> 27:41.030
you've never stepped outside
the palace gates

27:41.030 --> 27:42.490
or harmed the demon realm.

27:47.350 --> 27:48.680
I won't hate you.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.640
But if you dare offend me again...

27:51.640 --> 27:52.510
I won't.

27:53.790 --> 27:55.400
So we're friends now?

27:56.030 --> 27:56.760
I suppose so.

28:01.960 --> 28:03.690
Do you know how to make noodles?

28:06.750 --> 28:09.550
I feed on the spiritual energy
of heaven and earth.

28:09.570 --> 28:11.570
How would I know how to make noodles?

28:15.650 --> 28:16.810
Then you're in for a treat.

28:16.810 --> 28:17.680
Wait here for me.

28:17.680 --> 28:18.740
Don't go anywhere.

28:24.200 --> 28:24.870
Zhang.

28:25.680 --> 28:26.720
How are the steamed buns coming along?

28:26.720 --> 28:27.240
Almost ready.

28:27.240 --> 28:29.550
I heard you were promoted
to the Imperial Kitchen.

28:29.550 --> 28:30.640
A real blessing, wasn't it?

28:30.640 --> 28:31.240
Yes, sure.

28:31.350 --> 28:32.350
This transfer...

28:32.590 --> 28:33.960
Your Highness!

28:34.110 --> 28:35.170
Please forgive me!

28:35.240 --> 28:36.640
I didn't know Your Highness's presence.

28:36.640 --> 28:38.440
I crave Your Highness's pardon!

28:42.510 --> 28:43.240
You may rise.

28:45.160 --> 28:47.090
I'd like to do some cooking myself.

28:48.830 --> 28:49.510
Have I somehow

28:49.510 --> 28:51.550
failed to please Your Highness
with my cooking?

28:51.550 --> 28:54.340
I beg Your Highness to give me
a second chance.

28:54.400 --> 28:55.400
You've done nothing wrong.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.270
I just feel like

28:56.510 --> 28:58.800
cooking something on my own.

28:59.000 --> 29:00.330
All of you may leave now.

29:00.550 --> 29:02.350
Please spare us, Your Highness!

29:02.720 --> 29:04.610
Once we step out of this room,

29:04.680 --> 29:05.780
we and our families

29:05.880 --> 29:07.520
will all lose our lives.

29:11.670 --> 29:12.660
Fine then.

29:13.110 --> 29:14.310
You can stay and help.

29:14.680 --> 29:15.790
Thank Your Highness.

29:15.790 --> 29:17.720
-Thank Your Highness.
-Get up now.

29:19.790 --> 29:20.750
Is there eel?

29:20.920 --> 29:21.310
Yes.

29:21.510 --> 29:22.270
Any shrimps?

29:22.790 --> 29:23.110
Yes.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.070
Ginger and scallions?

29:24.070 --> 29:24.400
Yes.

29:24.400 --> 29:25.160
Soy sauce?

29:25.160 --> 29:26.620
Yes, everything Your Highness needs!

29:26.620 --> 29:27.680
Let's get started!

29:29.550 --> 29:30.550
Debone the eel.

29:30.550 --> 29:32.750
Cut it into chunks about 3 fingers wide.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.880
Peel, devein, and butterfly

29:34.880 --> 29:36.810
the shrimps, leaving the tails on.

29:37.070 --> 29:38.440
The dough has to be moderately firm.

29:38.440 --> 29:38.880
Got it.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.070
Your Highness,

29:43.070 --> 29:44.130
the wok is cleaned.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.680
The Imperial Kitchen staff
are really good.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.810
Look how spotlessly clean this wok is.

29:49.920 --> 29:50.880
Bring the ingredients over.

29:50.880 --> 29:51.540
Right away!

30:01.960 --> 30:02.600
Terrific.

30:02.680 --> 30:03.590
Wonderful.

30:03.680 --> 30:05.070
Thanks to Your Highness's instructions,

30:05.070 --> 30:07.550
I'm sure these noodles
will be a heavenly delight.

30:07.550 --> 30:10.010
What a fantastic recipe
of Your Highness's!

30:33.680 --> 30:34.490
Careful, Your Highness.

30:34.490 --> 30:36.490
This chilli powder is rather spicy.

30:37.400 --> 30:38.260
To what extent?

30:38.310 --> 30:39.590
To an extreme extent.

30:39.680 --> 30:41.080
Where tears will well up?

30:41.920 --> 30:42.880
Yes, I guess.

31:34.340 --> 31:36.600
You humans really know how to enjoy life.

31:38.440 --> 31:39.300
Have some more.

31:42.270 --> 31:43.130
Why stare at me?

31:44.790 --> 31:46.880
You look great when you eat.

31:55.570 --> 31:57.140
Is the salt level alright?

31:57.790 --> 31:58.200
Yes.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.330
Don't you find it spicy?

32:01.670 --> 32:02.330
Is it spicy?

32:06.400 --> 32:08.400
Then it must be perfectly seasoned.

32:14.240 --> 32:15.300
What are these for?

32:15.400 --> 32:17.680
Could you peel the onions for me?

32:18.790 --> 32:19.750
I don't know how.

32:24.480 --> 32:25.680
You like eating this?

32:26.110 --> 32:26.550
Yes.

32:28.960 --> 32:29.400
Fine.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.060
Onions are difficult to peel.

33:15.350 --> 33:17.210
I'm just peeling an onion for you.

33:17.550 --> 33:19.010
What's so moving about it?

33:26.590 --> 33:28.430
This snuff powder is a tribute
from foreign states.

33:28.430 --> 33:29.350
A sniff of it is enough

33:29.350 --> 33:31.880
to have one's eyes watering
and nose running.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.000
Hold still.

33:35.270 --> 33:35.680
Yes.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.480
I'll present you something fun.

33:58.070 --> 33:59.600
What on earth are you doing?

34:06.830 --> 34:08.230
Men rarely cry, but they do

34:08.230 --> 34:10.030
when they're struck by true sorrow.

34:10.030 --> 34:11.000
I don't believe

34:11.070 --> 34:12.600
you have no sad story at all.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.280
My father says

34:14.360 --> 34:15.530
making friends

34:15.590 --> 34:17.800
is the greatest joy in life

34:17.920 --> 34:20.449
and worth being celebrated
with many drinks.

34:20.840 --> 34:22.699
Your account of the human emperor

34:22.949 --> 34:25.010
makes him sound less abominable now.

34:26.480 --> 34:27.210
Here you are.

34:29.480 --> 34:30.340
Where's yours?

34:30.800 --> 34:31.460
Right here.

34:35.590 --> 34:36.350
Well...

34:36.920 --> 34:38.190
As a lady within palace walls,

34:38.190 --> 34:39.400
I can't hold my liquor.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.320
Little wine though it is,

34:40.320 --> 34:42.360
it symbolizes heartfelt friendship.

34:42.360 --> 34:42.949
Drink up!

34:58.590 --> 34:59.450
You drank it up?

35:00.630 --> 35:02.160
Didn't you say, "Drink up"?

35:17.260 --> 35:19.060
You really can hold your liquor.

35:20.330 --> 35:21.130
One more jug.

35:23.110 --> 35:25.230
Tell me how many years you've lived.

35:26.840 --> 35:27.840
Several thouand.

35:28.630 --> 35:30.430
I can't recall the exact number.

35:30.710 --> 35:32.970
You must've been through many hardships

35:33.280 --> 35:35.540
during these thousands of years, right?

35:39.230 --> 35:40.690
I can't recall any either.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.550
Cheers.

35:58.760 --> 36:00.910
Have you ever loved a person?

36:01.110 --> 36:02.110
Or a demon?

36:04.390 --> 36:05.450
I'm the Demon King.

36:06.550 --> 36:08.550
I've devoted all my heart to demons.

36:09.650 --> 36:11.310
It has no room for anyone else.

36:15.350 --> 36:15.880
Come on.

36:16.880 --> 36:18.210
Let's have more drinks.

36:30.360 --> 36:31.670
You never get drunk.

36:31.670 --> 36:34.040
Why didn't you tell me that?

36:34.220 --> 36:36.480
So much fine wine of mine has been wasted.

36:37.040 --> 36:39.940
This could have lasted me quite a while.

36:39.970 --> 36:41.370
You're a human princess.

36:41.410 --> 36:43.230
Why stint on a few jugs of wine?

36:43.710 --> 36:44.630
Yeah.

36:45.960 --> 36:48.280
It's not easy to be a princess.

36:51.550 --> 36:53.480
You're quite generous sometimes.

36:54.110 --> 36:55.470
For example, you didn't

36:55.760 --> 36:58.090
hesitate much to return Fuxi Zither to me.

36:58.520 --> 37:00.650
You even asked to make friends with me.

37:02.960 --> 37:04.670
Only with you.

37:07.260 --> 37:07.800
Yeah.

37:08.910 --> 37:11.370
I've never fraternized with another human.

37:12.840 --> 37:14.240
I'd only do that with you.

37:16.610 --> 37:17.820
You don't get it.

37:18.880 --> 37:20.680
You're ignorant of everything.

37:33.400 --> 37:35.400
You don't have spiritual power now.

37:35.480 --> 37:37.880
You might catch a cold for standing

37:37.880 --> 37:39.110
in the wind.

37:39.710 --> 37:40.170
What...

37:40.710 --> 37:41.640
What did you say?

37:41.960 --> 37:43.480
The wind is rising.

37:43.800 --> 37:44.860
It's getting cold.

37:45.180 --> 37:46.910
I'll shield you from the chill.

37:48.190 --> 37:49.710
I'll protect you.

37:50.070 --> 37:51.000
Don't be afraid.

37:59.500 --> 38:01.230
Now you even want to protect me?

38:01.590 --> 38:02.230
Yes.

38:04.930 --> 38:06.790
Why are you treating me this well?

38:12.480 --> 38:13.710
You fool,

38:14.960 --> 38:17.400
I'm trying hard not to do more.

38:34.670 --> 38:35.440
I am...

38:37.890 --> 38:38.810
a demon.

38:49.190 --> 38:50.280
I know.

38:51.000 --> 38:53.070
I know you are a demon—

38:53.150 --> 38:56.460
one who has lived for an age,
and then another, and another.

38:57.320 --> 39:00.190
You've seen humans' deceit

39:00.270 --> 39:03.070
and witnessed your fellow demons
turning against each other.

39:03.070 --> 39:04.190
You don't easily put trust

39:04.190 --> 39:06.320
in humans or demons.

39:06.480 --> 39:08.800
But you still hope to
restore demons' reputation

39:08.800 --> 39:11.070
and clear their name.

39:11.360 --> 39:13.290
You firmly believe
that you must be

39:13.550 --> 39:16.320
responsible for all demons
since you're the Demon King.

39:16.320 --> 39:19.550
That's why
you've been utterly strict with yourself,

39:19.840 --> 39:21.570
why you've cultivated so hard,

39:21.760 --> 39:24.890
and why you've never allowed yourself
to make a mistake.

39:30.670 --> 39:32.430
Right in here,

39:32.800 --> 39:34.510
you've built up

39:35.110 --> 39:35.840
one barrier

39:36.110 --> 39:38.070
after another.

39:40.060 --> 39:41.730
Because you're afraid.

39:42.320 --> 39:44.660
You fear being seen through.

39:44.710 --> 39:46.910
You fear becoming dependent on others.

39:48.060 --> 39:49.420
You fear...

39:49.450 --> 39:51.280
that you'll end up getting disappointed

39:51.280 --> 39:53.030
when you have expectations.

39:53.510 --> 39:54.670
You also fear

39:54.670 --> 39:56.280
that you'll lose something

39:56.280 --> 39:57.750
after attaining it.

39:57.880 --> 40:00.450
That'll only bring you more pain.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.510
So,

40:09.030 --> 40:10.630
each of your barriers in here

40:11.030 --> 40:12.590
has a name.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.520
One is called

40:16.110 --> 40:17.800
"saying what you don't mean."

40:18.040 --> 40:19.240
One is called

40:19.550 --> 40:21.400
"never speaking your mind."

40:21.510 --> 40:22.760
Another is called

40:23.000 --> 40:23.670
"too"

40:24.030 --> 40:24.590
"proud"

40:24.760 --> 40:25.320
"to"

40:25.630 --> 40:26.290
"confide."

40:28.960 --> 40:30.170
You've said so much,

40:30.670 --> 40:32.330
as if you know me well.

40:37.800 --> 40:39.480
You old demon,

40:40.320 --> 40:41.480
your words are mean,

40:41.760 --> 40:43.280
but your heart is tender.

40:43.280 --> 40:46.710
You should enjoy
the genuine love of this world.

40:47.360 --> 40:48.380
To laugh

40:48.710 --> 40:49.700
and cry—

40:49.840 --> 40:52.240
that's the way
to complete your demon life!

40:54.510 --> 40:55.510
Are you truly

40:57.550 --> 40:58.960
a human princess?
